---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { IMAGE_SOURCE_NOTICE, PRIVACY_PATH, REFUNDS_PATH, SITE_BRAND, TERMS_PATH } from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="CC0 License"
	description={`iStockVisual.com library images are AI-generated and released under CC0. Commercial and personal use, no attribution required, all sizes and formats. ${IMAGE_SOURCE_NOTICE}`}
	heading="CC0 License"
	lede={`${IMAGE_SOURCE_NOTICE} Library images are dedicated to the public under Creative Commons Zero (CC0). Commercial and personal use are allowed. Attribution is not required on any size — including 512, 1K, and Pro downloads.`}
>
	<h2>1. What this license covers</h2>
	<p>
		This license applies to photos, illustrations, vectors, and 3D stills published in the
		{SITE_BRAND} library (“Library Content”), including files you download from a detail page and
		recognizable derivatives you make with the on-page editor or the studio tools.
		{IMAGE_SOURCE_NOTICE} They are produced for this site.
	</p>
	<p>
		To the extent we hold copyright in Library Content, we waive those rights under
		<strong>Creative Commons Zero 1.0 Universal (CC0)</strong>. You may copy, modify, distribute,
		and use the files, including for commercial purposes, without asking permission and without
		giving credit.
	</p>
	<p>
		<strong>512</strong> and <strong>1K</strong> (1024 long edge) are free. <strong>2K</strong>,
		<strong>4K</strong>, and <strong>8K</strong> need an active Pro plan or pass. CC0 applies to
		every size and to JPG, PNG, WEBP, and SVG. A larger file is more pixels, not a different
		copyright grant. Access to HD files is still governed by your plan and the
		<a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>2. What you may do</h2>
	<p>Subject to this license and our <a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>, you may:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Use Library Content in personal and commercial projects: websites, ads, social posts, decks,
			packaging, editorial layouts, and print
		</li>
		<li>
			Edit, crop, color-grade, remove background, expand, convert format, vectorize, resize for
			social frames, watermark, or composite with your own work
		</li>
		<li>Use Library Content in client work</li>
		<li>Keep files you already downloaded if a plan later ends, still under CC0</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>3. Attribution (optional)</h2>
	<p>
		Credit is not required. If you want to mention the source, wording equivalent to
		<strong> Generated by {SITE_BRAND}</strong> is enough. Each asset page includes optional
		copy-ready credit.
	</p>

	<h2>4. What you may not do</h2>
	<p>
		CC0 does not let you misuse the site or mislead people about the files. Under our Terms you
		may not:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Sell, license, or redistribute the original or lightly modified file as a standalone stock
			asset, prompt pack, or competing library item
		</li>
		<li>Claim exclusive ownership of unmodified Library Content, or register it as your trademark</li>
		<li>Use Library Content to imply that iStockVisual endorses a person, product, or cause</li>
		<li>Use Library Content in unlawful, deceptive, or hateful material</li>
		<li>
			Scrape, bulk-harvest, or automate downloads beyond ordinary personal or studio use, including
			after the HD fair-use cap in the Terms
		</li>
		<li>Share Pro login details so others can download HD files on your account</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>5. Browser tools and your own files</h2>
	<p>
		Image Editor, Convert, Vectorizer, Social Resizer, Batch Watermark, and Palette Generator run in
		your browser. Files you choose on your device for those tools are not uploaded to iStockVisual
		and remain yours. If you start from Library Content, this CC0 license still applies to that
		content and to recognizable derivatives of it.
	</p>
	<p>
		On-page editor exports from library files follow the same size rules as downloads: free users
		stay on 512 / 1K; Pro may export larger tiers. Expand on library assets is a Pro feature.
	</p>
	<p>
		Visual search may upload a query photo so we can match the library. That upload is handled under
		the <a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a> and is not added to the public library.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Trademarks, people, and AI-generated scenes</h2>
	<p>
		{IMAGE_SOURCE_NOTICE} Library Content is produced for general creative use. Scenes may be
		stylized or fictional. CC0 covers our copyright in the file; it does not clear real trademarks,
		logos, or identifiable people that you add, or regulated claims you make next to an image. Do
		not treat a generated interior, product, or skyline as a photo of a specific real property or
		brand unless you have independently verified that.
	</p>

	<h2>7. Fair use, refunds, and changes</h2>
	<p>
		HD speed limits do not change this license. Refunds are in the
		<a href={REFUNDS_PATH}>Refund Policy</a>. We may update this license; the version on this page
		applies to new downloads from the date it is posted. Files you already downloaded remain usable
		under the license that applied when you downloaded them, unless we must restrict use to comply
		with law.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
